    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17172,
        "title": "Gleichheitsoperator",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145338,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können Vergleiche verwenden, um zu überprüfen, ob ein Spielstatusname gleich oder ungleich einem anderen Spielstatusnamen ist.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um zu überprüfen, ob ein String gleich einem anderen String ist, können wir den <strong>strikten Gleichheitsoperator</strong>, <code>===</code>, verwenden.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>===</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145340,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn der String auf der linken Seite gleich dem String auf der rechten Seite ist, wie in <code>\"PLAYING\" === \"PLAYING\"</code>, ist das Ergebnis <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"PLAYING\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>===</code> und schließlich <code>\"PLAYING\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145341,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn der String auf der linken Seite nicht gleich dem String auf der rechten Seite ist, wie in <code>\"PLAYING\" === \"GAME_OVER\"</code>, ist das Ergebnis <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;GAME_OVER&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>===</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"GAME_OVER\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145342,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können auch Variablen, die Strings speichern, miteinander vergleichen, wie in <code>state1 === state2</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"state3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" state1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" state2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PAUSED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(state1 === state2);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>state1</code>, gefolgt von <code>===</code> und schließlich <code>state2</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145343,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was kann der Gleichheitsoperator <code>===</code> tun?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es überprüft, ob ein Spielstatusname gleich einem anderen Spielstatusnamen ist</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es überprüft, ob ein Spielstatusname größer ist als ein anderer Spielstatusname</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es überprüft, ob ein Spielstatusname gleich einem anderen Spielstatusnamen ist.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145344,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher dieser Operatoren ist der strikte Gleichheitsoperator?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>===</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>===</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145345,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird in der Konsole angezeigt?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;BOSS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;BOS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145346,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche dieser Vergleiche ergibt <code>true</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"PAUSED\" === \"PAUSED\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"PAUSED\" === \"PLAYING\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"PAUSED\" === \"PAUSED\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145347,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überprüfe, ob <code>playerChoice</code> gleich <code>correctChoice</code> ist.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerChoice = \" /><text value=\"&quot;attack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correctChoice = \" /><text value=\"&quot;block&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerChoice === correctChoice);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>===</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145348,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Speichere einen String in <code>requiredState</code>, um den Vergleich <code>false</code> zu machen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requiredState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PAUSED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(currentState === requiredState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"PAUSED\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145349,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Speichere einen String in <code>item2</code>, um das Ergebnis des Vergleichs <code>false</code> zu machen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;health potion&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;health potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mana potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDuplicate = item1 === item2;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isDuplicate);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"mana potion\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145350,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überprüfe, ob <code>\"PLAYING\"</code> gleich <code>\"GAME_OVER\"</code> ist, indem du <code>===</code> codierst.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"25\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;PLAYING&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;GAME_OVER&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>===</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17173,
        "title": "Ungleichheitsoperator",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145351,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um zu überprüfen, ob ein Spielwert nicht gleich einem anderen Wert ist, verwenden wir den <strong>strikten Ungleichheitsoperator</strong>, <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>!==</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145352,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn der Wert auf der linken Seite nicht gleich dem Wert auf der rechten Seite ist, wie in <code>\"sword\" !== \"shield\"</code>, ist das Ergebnis <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"sword\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>!==</code> und schließlich <code>\"shield\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145353,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn der Wert auf der linken Seite gleich dem Wert auf der rechten Seite ist, wie in <code>\"boss\" !== \"boss\"</code>, ist das Ergebnis <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;boss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um das Ergebnis eines Vergleichs in einer Variable zu speichern, verwenden wir das <code>=</code>-Zeichen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelChanged = \" /><text value=\"&quot;level1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;level2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>=</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche dieser Aussagen ist <code>true</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"goblin\" !== \"dragon\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"dragon\" !== \"dragon\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"goblin\" !== \"dragon\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145356,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher dieser Operatoren ist der Ungleichheitsoperator?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>!==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>===</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>!==</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird in der Konsole angezeigt?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>true</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145358,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was macht der Ungleichheitsoperator <code>!==</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es überprüft, ob ein Spielwert nicht gleich einem anderen Wert ist</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es überprüft, ob ein Spielwert gleich einem anderen Wert ist</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es überprüft, ob ein Spielwert nicht gleich einem anderen Wert ist.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überprüfe, ob <code>playerGuess</code> nicht gleich <code>secretCode</code> ist.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerGuess = \" /><text value=\"&quot;redKey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" secretCode = \" /><text value=\"&quot;blueKey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerGuess !== secretCode);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>!==</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145360,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Speichere einen String in <code>equippedSprite</code>, um <code>false</code> in der Konsole anzuzeigen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;enemy.png&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equippedSprite = \" /><text value=\"&quot;hero.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equippedSprite !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;hero.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"hero.png\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Speichere einen String in <code>nextState</code>, um das Ergebnis des Vergleichs <code>true</code> zu machen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;menu&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;menu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nextState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stateChanged = currentState !== nextState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(stateChanged);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"playing\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überprüfe, ob <code>bossName</code> nicht gleich <code>minionName</code> ist, indem du <code>!==</code> codierst.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Titan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minionName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bossName !== minionName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>!==</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
